    "detailed_description": "<strong>Loop through the same level and spot the differences that may or may not occur.</strong><br><br><i>You start the game at Level 1-1, but for some reason the game just won't let you finish 1-1.<br>Instead it will start to loop inifinitely. But you can make it stop!<br>At each loop, there is a chance that something in the level has changed.<br><br>Find the change and enter the red pipe. If you think nothing has changed, simply continue to let the level loop.<br>Each correct decision will lead you one step closer to clear level 1-1.<br>However, if you make a wrong decision or if you couldn't find the change, you will need to start from zero again.<br><br>Choose the correct way consecutivley 10x, to clear level 1-1.</i><br><br><br><br>Changes occur randomly and in random order, so you can clear the game multiple times, but seeing different changes.<br><br>Features:<br>Horror Anomalities - replaces few changes with a spooky version<br>Inifinity Health - enemies can not defeat you<br>99 Lives - start the game with 99 lives<br>?????? - clear the game once to unlock it",
